  - My sheep... Atto, the brave little one, wandered off chasing a butterfly again.
    The others followed, of course.
  - "If you could find them and bring them safely back before nightfall, I'd be in
    your debt. Watch out for the wolves \u2013 they've grown bold lately."
  - The path through the Whispering Grove is shorter, but denser. The longer route
    around the lake is safer. The choice is yours, traveller.
